  unitName: "Twinkle Snow Miku (7\u2605)"
  unitId: 820297
  unitNumber: 8388
  description: A young lady gifted with a wondrous voice, it was said that she came
    to Grand Gaia in the middle of the night. As the midnight silence gave way to
    the sunrise, a soft song could be heard coming from her lips. Everyone who heard
    it felt at peace with the world, and evil seemed to recede from the night. It
    was said that she was looking for her friends, although she could not remember
    what they looked like. Thanks to the kind hearts of those that she met, she began
    a journey across the land as she began her search. Soon, many would know her
    song...
  summonDesc: Come with me! We'll fly to our winter wonderland!
  fusionDesc: It's time to celebrate the season with a song! Will you join me?
